{"articleNo":"662","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=662&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"열린사이버대학교 학점교류 수강 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.11","hit":"17435","attachments":[{"name":"OCU개설교과목_목록(교양129과목)090205.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=662&attachNo=69288"},{"name":"OCU_수강신청원2009.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=662&attachNo=69289"},{"name":"시스템사용료_수납방법_및_절차.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=662&attachNo=69290"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY수평선B'\">2009학년도 1학기</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY수평선B'\">열린사이버대학교(OCU) 학점교류 수강 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">학생들에게 다양한 교양교과목의 수강 선택기회를 제공하기 위하여 열린사이버대학교(OCU)와 학술교류 협약에 따라 아래와 같이 수강신청을 안내하오니 기한내에 수강&nbsp; 신청을 하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">수강자격</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">(4개조건 모두 충족하여야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 현 재학생으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균(전체학기) 3.0 이상인 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 7학기차 이하 등록자 (4학년 2학기 이상인자 수강불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 수강신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009. 2. 17 ~ 2. 20(금) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강과목 : 학기당 교양선택 1과목/3학점이내</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">학기당 이수학점(21학점) 초과하여 수강 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교내 교양필수과목과 동일 교과목은 신청할 수 없음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출서류 : OCU수강신청원&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">라. 제출장소 : 교무연구과 학사지원팀(글로벌관 456호)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">, ☎Y: '굴림'\"&gt;<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">3. 수강료 납부 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강료 금액 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">과목당 24,000원</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">(본인 부담)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009. 3. 2(월) ~ 3. 9(월)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 납부방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) OCU컨소시엄 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">홈페이지(cons.ocu.ac.kr)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> 로그인 후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[시스템사용료납부]메뉴를 이용하여 납부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 로그인 방법 : </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ID : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">kit + 학번</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; PASSWORD : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">주민번호 뒷자리</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 납부유형 : 실시간 계좌이체, 신용카드, 가상계좌(무통장입금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 납부확인 : [시스템사용료 납부 확인]메뉴에서 확인가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <font size=\"2\"><strong>* 기타 상세안내는첨부한 시스템사용료(수강료) 납부안내문 참조<br></strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">4. 2009학년도 1학기 OCU 개설교과목 목록</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> : 첨부문서 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009. 2</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">교무연구과장<br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
